messages.text:
It is said that water will not grow
stagnant as long as it keeps flowing...{be00}
So as long as I keep moving onward...{be01}

I won't give up, even if I am defeated!
That toughness is the pride of an{be00}
Ace Trainer!

When riding leaves, the direction they
float in will depend on which side you{be00}
got on from.{be01}
Don't worry! If you keep trying, you'll
find our Leader sooner or later!
